WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.400
This is H2F Trainer.

2
00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:07.687
Every day starts on Today,
with your workout ready.

3
00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:11.915
Build the main workout
your way: straight

4
00:00:11.915 --> 00:00:15.141
sets, timed stations, or
a circuit with rounds.

5
00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:20.196
Leaders build an eight-week
Integrator program

6
00:00:20.196 --> 00:00:22.285
once, and send it to every Soldier.

7
00:00:22.285 --> 00:00:24.954
Each one gets weights for their group.

8
00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:29.519
Remedial plans add up to five sessions a

9
00:00:29.519 --> 00:00:33.195
week, on top of regular
training, for twelve weeks.

10
00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:38.318
Three hundred plus exercises,
each with steps and coaching cues.

11
00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:40.948
Too hard, or too easy?

12
00:00:40.948 --> 00:00:44.821
Every exercise has an
easier, and a harder version.

13
00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:50.574
Add your own exercises with photos,
and share them with another Soldier.

14
00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:53.245
Hurt?

15
00:00:53.245 --> 00:00:57.425
Tap where it hurts, and the app
builds a recovery training plan.

16
00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:03.330
It moves in three phases: calm it
down, rebuild, and return to training.

17
00:01:04.450 --> 00:01:08.818
Each day has a focus, with clear
signs for when to see a provider.

18
00:01:09.950 --> 00:01:11.566
Readiness fits your day.

19
00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:12.695
Live your values.

20
00:01:13.850 --> 00:01:15.317
Fuel your training.

21
00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:17.938
Steady your mind.

22
00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:20.602
And sleep to recover.

23
00:01:22.950 --> 00:01:25.519
In Squad, share your
week with your leader.

24
00:01:25.519 --> 00:01:27.968
Leaders see the whole
squad in one place,

25
00:01:27.968 --> 00:01:30.817
and can send a training
plan to everyone.

26
00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:35.827
Earn ribbons as you train, and
keep them all in your medal case.

27
00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:38.964
H2F Trainer.

28
00:01:38.964 --> 00:01:40.462
Get after it.
